EC._inverse(uint256) (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#73-89) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- q = r / newR (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#82)
	- (r,newR) = (newR,r - q * newR) (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#85)
TaskRegister.solveTask(uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256) (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#933-971) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- serviceReward = taskReard.mul(serviceFee).div(MAX_PERCENT) (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#960)
	- referrerReward = serviceReward.mul(referrerFee).div(MAX_PERCENT) (../sb/0xeb897ad24189a911cad00c071fc7182f5753a3d3.sol#963)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

